<article class="alert ">
	<div>
		
		

		
		<div class="alert__container">
			
			<div class="alert__content">
				<h4 class="alert__title">
					Iraq: Humanitarian Call for Witnesses from the Gulf War 1990-1991
				</h4>

									<div class="alert__description">
						<p>Publication in <a href="https://www.icrc.org/en/article/iraq-humanitarian-call-witnesses-gulf-war-1990-1991">EN</a> and <a href="https://www.icrc.org/ar/article/iraq-humanitarian-call-witnesses-gulf-war-1990-1991">AR</a></p>
					</div>
							</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</article>
									

<article class="alert ">
	<div>
		
		

		
		<div class="alert__container">
			
			<div class="alert__content">
				<h4 class="alert__title">
					International Armed Conflict between the Russian Federation and Ukraine
				</h4>

									<div class="alert__description">
						<p><span>Міжнародний збройний конфлікт між Російською Федерацією та Україною&nbsp;</span><br><span>Международный вооруженный конфликт </span>между Российской Федерацией и Украиной<br>&nbsp;</p><p><span lang="EN-GB">Are you looking for your family member? Please </span><a href="https://uruprecase.powerappsportals.com/en-US/" target="_blank"><span lang="EN-GB">fill in the online form</span></a><span lang="EN-GB"> &nbsp;or </span><a href="https://familylinks.icrc.org/directory" target="_blank"><span lang="EN-GB">contact us</span></a><span lang="EN-GB">.</span><span>&nbsp;</span></p><p><span lang="RU-RU">Ви шукаєте члена своєї сім'ї ? Будь ласка, </span><a href="https://uruprecase.powerappsportals.com/uk-UA/" target="_blank"><span lang="RU-RU">заповніть </span><span lang="UK-UA">контактну </span><span lang="RU-RU">форму онлайн</span></a><span lang="RU-RU"> або </span><a href="https://familylinks.icrc.org/directory" target="_blank"><span lang="RU-RU">зв’яжіться з нами</span></a><span lang="RU-RU">.</span><span>&nbsp;</span></p><p><span lang="RU-RU">Вы ищете члена своей семьи? Пожалуйста, </span><a href="https://uruprecase.powerappsportals.com/ru-RU/" target="_blank"><span lang="RU-RU">заполните контактную форму онлайн</span></a><span lang="RU-RU">&nbsp; или </span><a href="https://familylinks.icrc.org/directory" target="_blank"><span lang="RU-RU">свяжитесь с нами</span></a><span lang="RU-RU">.</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href="https://www.icrc.org/en/document/central-tracing-agency-missing-persons-ukraine" target="_blank" title="Find out more about the ICRC&apos;s Central Tracing Agency Bureau for the International Armed Conflict between the Russian Federation and Ukraine"><span lang="EN-US">Find</span><span lang="RU-RU"> </span><span lang="EN-US">out</span><span lang="RU-RU"> </span><span lang="EN-US">more</span><span lang="RU-RU"> </span><span lang="EN-US">about</span><span lang="RU-RU"> </span><span lang="EN-US">the</span><span lang="RU-RU"> </span><span lang="EN-US">ICRC</span><span lang="RU-RU">’</span><span lang="EN-US">s</span><span lang="RU-RU"> </span><span lang="EN-US">Central</span><span lang="RU-RU"> </span><span lang="EN-US">Tracing</span><span lang="RU-RU"> </span><span lang="EN-US">Agency</span><span lang="RU-RU"> </span><span lang="EN-US">Bureau</span><span lang="RU-RU"> </span><span lang="EN-US">for</span><span lang="RU-RU"> </span><span lang="EN-US">the</span><span lang="RU-RU"> </span><span lang="EN-US">International</span><span lang="RU-RU"> </span><span lang="EN-US">Armed</span><span lang="RU-RU"> </span><span lang="EN-US">Conflict</span><span lang="RU-RU"> </span><span lang="EN-US">between the Russian Federation and</span><span lang="RU-RU"> </span><span lang="EN-US">Ukraine</span></a><br><a href="https://blogs.icrc.org/ua/2022/06/14/poshuk-znykli-bezvisty-chervoniy-hrest-2022/" target="_blank"><span>Дізнайтеся більше про Бюро Центрального агентства з розшуку МКЧХ (Бюро ЦАР) для міжнародного збройного конфлікту між Російською Федерацією та Україною</span></a><br><a href="https://www.icrc.org/ru/document/byuro-centralnogo-agentstva-po-rozysku-mkkk-po-voprosam-svyazannym-s-mezhdunarodnym"><span lang="RU">Узнайте больше о Бюро Центрального агентства по розыску МККК (Бюро ЦАР) по вопросам, связанным с международным вооруженным конфликтом между Российской Федерацией и Украиной</span></a></p>
					</div>
